273: +    print their keys flat, so reading `content` or `label` off the top level silently sees None and
274: +    the check fails for the envelope rather than for the file browser. Unwrap when the envelope is
275: +    there and fall through when it is not, so this keeps working whichever shape a caller produces.
276: +    """
277: +    response = run_service('read-source', source_id)
278: +    body = response.get('payload')
279: +    return body if isinstance(body, dict) else response
